# Gifts of the Griffon (crystalWar 15) at Rholont beside In a Haze of Glory (a Lua quest, available once Perils of the
# Griffon is completed: a GM; its Rholont reply is the Event 637 in every state): a level 99 Warrior in Southern San
# d'Oria [S] with Steamed Rams completed (missions as the main flow). An Event reply ties 637 and the two rotate by the
# last event id (first talk: Gifts', in container order; the same state again: 637); a Progress reply beats it every
# time. Available, Prog 1 (a GM): 637. Accepted by a GM (no begin: no plumes held), 6 traded (Option 63), the Timer 0:
# 34, finished: the Timer the next tally; the Timer 0 again (a GM): 34 again. Before the Timer: 46, then 637. A full
# inventory and a past Timer: 35, finished: the Timer 0, no plumes fit; the Timer past again: 35 again. The inventory
# freed, Option 64 and the Timer equal to now (1,800,000,000: not before it): 35 gives 6 plumes (7 less the bits
# traded). A plume held: 33, then 637. Option 127 (all traded) and a full inventory: 24, finished: no room, not
# completed; 24 again; freed: 24, completed. Set back to available at Prog 2 (GMs): 23, finished: begun; again: 23.
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Rholont/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/23 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/24 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/34 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/35
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=-167.043,-2,55.484 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.SteamedRams completed  # hasCompletedFirstQuest (Steamed Rams' arm)
quest CrystalWar.PerilsOfTheGriffon completed # In a Haze of Glory available: Rholont 637 (an Event)
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
charvar Quest[7][15]Prog 1              # a GM (available): Rholont answers only at Prog 2
trigger Rholont                         # Prog 1: no Gifts reply: 637
finish-if-event
quest CrystalWar.GiftsOfTheGriffon accepted # a GM: no begin, no plumes
charvar Quest[7][15]Option 63           # a GM: 6 traded
trigger Rholont                         # no plume, the Timer 0: 34
finish                                  # the Timer: the next tally
charvar Quest[7][15]Timer 0             # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # 34 again
finish
trigger Rholont                         # before the Timer: 46 (an Event), first in order
finish-if-event
trigger Rholont                         # the same state again: 637
finish-if-event
fill-inventory
charvar Quest[7][15]Timer 1             # a GM: a time past
trigger Rholont                         # 35
finish                                  # the Timer 0; the plumes do not fit
charvar Quest[7][15]Timer 1             # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # 35 again
finish
free-inventory
charvar Quest[7][15]Option 64           # a GM: only bit 6 traded
charvar Quest[7][15]Timer 1800000000    # a GM: now (not before it)
trigger Rholont                         # 35
finish                                  # the Timer 0; 7 less 1 traded: 6 plumes
trigger Rholont                         # a plume held, 1 traded: 33 (an Event)
finish-if-event
trigger Rholont                         # the same state again: 637
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[7][15]Option 127          # a GM: all seven traded
fill-inventory
trigger Rholont                         # 7 traded: 24
finish                                  # no room for the Deathstone: not completed
trigger Rholont                         # 24 again
finish
free-inventory
trigger Rholont                         # 24
finish                                  # completed; Claws of the Griffon's Timer
quest CrystalWar.GiftsOfTheGriffon available # a GM
charvar Quest[7][15]Prog 2              # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # available, Prog 2: 23
finish                                  # begun; 7 plumes
quest CrystalWar.GiftsOfTheGriffon available # a GM
charvar Quest[7][15]Prog 2              # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # 23 again
finish
